# Work-only environment for ~/kpler.
#
# GH_TOKEN is deliberately NOT set here. gh account selection is handled by the
# `gh` wrapper (~/bin/gh), which keys off the repo's remote URL — the same rule
# git uses. Pinning a token per folder breaks as soon as a personal repo lives
# under ~/kpler, or a work repo under ~/projects.
#
# Put genuinely work-scoped, non-secret vars here. For secrets prefer the keyring
# (e.g. `gh auth token`) over writing them to disk.
